section('8. TDD 層級與驗證結果',table(['層級／套件','結果','界線'],[['L0 私有 codec','PASS','framing/version/checksum/UTF8/欄位/state/binding/安全引用與界限'],['L1 controlled component','PASS','同一 adapter 原始碼 + 真實檔案 + stage/point failure injection；非另一份假的交易實作'],['L2 Port boundary','PASS','產品公開 Port 建立與持有 lease、讀取、提交、衝突'],['L3 native/process','PASS on Windows10','跨程序 Busy/drop/death、五個 crash checkpoint/reopen、硬連結/大小寫別名拒絕'],['完整 IO suite','220 PASS / 0 FAIL / 0 ignored','196 原產品 + 19 support + 5 新回歸，非單檔編譯代替模組驗證'],['L4 adjacent regressions','101 + 222 + 84 PASS','Ports/Adapters library、WORK 全套、HOST library'],['L5 system / Windows11','NOT RUN','沒有 UI/系統/部署驗收聲明']]))
section('9. 需求 → BDD → TDD → 結果',table(['Requirement / BDD','Tests','結果'],[[r['requirement']+' / '+r['bdd'],', '.join(r['tests']),r['result']]for r in trace]))
